{
  "id": "2CO.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Korintiyawa 5",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Buɗaɗɗen Littafi Mai Tsarki, Sabon Rai Don Kowa™ Neman RubutaccenIzini © 2009, 2020 ta hannun Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Hausa Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 2009, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" wani tambarin ne da aka yi wa rajista a ofishi Lamba Ƙerar da Tambari a Amurka ta hannun Biblica, Inc. Wanda aka yi amfani ta wurin samun izini. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wurin zamanmu a sama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yanzu mun san cewa in an hallaka tentin duniyan nan da muke ciki, muna da wani gini daga Allah, madawwamin gida a sama, wanda ba da hannuwan mutum ne suka gina shi ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kafin nan muna nishi, da marmari a yi mana sutura da gidanmu na sama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "don sa'ad da aka yi mana sutura, ba za a same mu tsirara ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa'ad da muke zaune a cikin jikin nan na duniya, nishi muke domin matsuwar da muke sha, ba domin muna so mu rabu da jikinmu na wannan duniya ba ne, sai dai don so muke yi a suturta mu da na Sama, domin mai rai ya shafe mai mutuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Allah ne ya yi mu domin wannan, ya kuma ba mu Ruhu a matsayin abin ajiya, yana kuma tabbatar da abin da zai zo nan gaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, kullum muna da tabbaci mun kuma san cewa, muddin muna a duniya cikin jikin nan, ana raba mu da Ubangiji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rayuwa bangaskiya muke, ba ta ganin ido ba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina cewa muna da tabbaci, za mu fi so mu rabu da jikin nan, mu kuma kasance a sama tare da Ubangiji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, niyyarmu ita ce, mu gamshe shi, ko muna a duniya cikin jikin nan, ko ba mu nan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gama dole dukanmu mu bayyana a gaban kujerar shari'ar Kiristi, domin kowannenmu yă karɓi ladan aikin da ya yi a wannan jiki, ko mai kyau ne ko marar kyau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hidimar sulhuntawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To, da yake mun san ko mene tsoron Ubangiji yake, muna ƙoƙari mu rinjaye mutane. Yadda muke kuwa, yana sane a sarari ga Allah, ina kuma fata yana nan a sarari a lamirinku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba ƙoƙari muke mu yabe kanmu a gare ku ba ne, sai dai muna ba ku damar yin taƙama da mu ne, don ku sami amsar da za ku ba wa waɗanda suke taƙama da abin da ake gani ne, a maimakon abin da yake cikin zuciya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In hankalinmu a taɓe yake, ai, saboda Allah ne, in kuwa cikin hankalinmu muke, ai, saboda ku ne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ƙaunar Kiristi a gare mu, ita take mallakarmu, saboda haka mun tabbata, da yake wani ya mutu saboda dukan mutane, ashe kuwa, mutuwarsu ce dukansu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya kuwa mutu ne saboda dukan mutane, domin kada waɗanda suke rayuwa kada su yi zaman ganin dama a nan gaba, sai dai su yi zaman wannan da ya mutu saboda su, aka kuma tashe shi saboda su.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, daga yanzu zuwa nan gaba, ba mu ƙara ɗaukan wani mutum bisa ga ganin duniya ba. Ko da yake a dā, mun ɗauki Kiristi haka, amma yanzu mun daina yin haka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, duk wanda yake cikin Kiristi, sabuwar halitta ce, tsohon al'amari ya shuɗe, sabon ya zo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duk wannan kuwa daga Allah ne, wanda ya sulhunta mu da kansa ta wurin Kiristi, ya kuma ba mu hidimar sulhu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wato, Allah ya sulhunta duniya zuwa kansa ta wurin Kiristi, ba ya lissafta zunuban mutane a kansu. Ya kuma danƙa mana saƙon sulhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saboda haka, mu jakadu ne na Kiristi, sai ka ce Allah kansa yake magana ta wurinmu. Muna roƙonku a madadin Kiristi. Ku sulhuntu da Allah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shi da bai san zunubi ba, Allah ya mai da shi kamar hadayar zunubi saboda mu, domin mu sami adalcin Allah ta wurinsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
